1. Definitions
--------------

1.1 "Software" means the contents of this repository other than the `artifacts/`
    directory and the files listed in Exhibit B, in source or built form,
    together with any later release of those contents.

1.2 "Restricted Party" means every entity listed in Schedule A, including its
    Affiliates, and every product, service, agent, model, dataset, IDE,
    marketplace or internal tool that such an entity operates, brands, funds or
    distributes, under its listed name or any current or future name.

1.3 "Affiliate" means any entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under
    common control with another entity, and any entity formed to hold all or
    part of another entity's business, including through merger, acquisition,
    rebranding or a change of legal name.

1.4 "Marketplace" means any public or private channel for distributing skills,
    prompts, plugins, agents, workflow templates or comparable material to
    third parties, whether a plugin store, skill registry, model marketplace,
    package index, model context source, or a directory that feeds one.

1.5 "Marketplace Ingestion" means collecting the Software by automated means —
    scraping, crawling, bulk downloading, mirroring, indexing, spidering — and
    republishing it, or substantial parts of it, in a Marketplace. Ordinary
    cloning, forking, and installing or building the Software for your own use
    is not Marketplace Ingestion.

1.6 "you" means the individual or entity exercising rights under this license.

